#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:931
msgid ""
"Choose the visual style for the left sidebar menu. Classic style keeps the "
"traditional WordPress layout; Modern style uses rounded background design "
"(similar to Notion)."
msgstr ""
"选择左侧菜单的视觉风格。经典风格保持 WordPress 传统样式，"
"现代风格采用圆角背景设计（类似 Notion）。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:932
msgid ""
"Set the basic appearance of the menu, including background and text colors."
msgstr "设置菜单的基本外观，包括背景色和文字颜色。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:933
msgid "Set the menu style on mouse hover."
msgstr "设置鼠标悬停时的菜单样式。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:934
msgid "Set the style for the currently selected menu item."
msgstr "设置当前选中菜单项的样式。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:935
msgid "Set menu dimensions, spacing, and border radius."
msgstr "设置菜单的尺寸、间距和圆角。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:936
msgid ""
"Settings exclusive to the Modern Minimal style, used to achieve a Notion-"
"like indent effect. Only takes effect when \"Modern Minimal Style\" is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"现代简约风格专属设置，用于实现类似 Notion 的缩进效果。"
"仅在选择「现代简约风格」时生效。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:937
msgid ""
"Some plugins use SVG icons which may cause color control issues. You can "
"replace them with standard Dashicons."
msgstr ""
"部分插件使用 SVG 图标，可能导致颜色控制问题。"
"你可以将它们替换为标准的 Dashicons 图标。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:938
msgid ""
"When enabled, administrators can customise the left sidebar menu order by "
"dragging. The order applies to all users."
msgstr "启用后，管理员可以通过拖拽来自定义左侧菜单的排序，排序结果将应用到所有用户。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:939
msgid ""
"Control the auto-collapse behavior of the left sidebar menu on specific "
"pages to improve the editing experience."
msgstr "控制左侧菜单在特定页面的自动折叠行为，提升编辑体验。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:940
msgid ""
"Display site branding at the top of the left sidebar menu, similar to a "
"Notion workspace identifier."
msgstr "在左侧菜单顶部显示站点标识，类似 Notion 的工作区标识。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:976
msgid "Modern Minimal Style"
msgstr "现代简约风格"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1065
msgid ""
"Choose the visual style for the left sidebar menu. \"Modern Minimal Style\" "
"references Notion with a rounded background design."
msgstr "选择左侧菜单的视觉风格。「现代简约风格」参考 Notion，采用圆角背景设计。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1072
msgid "Default: #f8fafc (fd-gray-50)"
msgstr "默认值：#f8fafc (fd-gray-50)"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1078
#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1128
msgid "Default: #ffffff (white)"
msgstr "默认值：#ffffff（白色）"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1084
msgid "Default: #334155 (fd-gray-700)"
msgstr "默认值：#334155 (fd-gray-700)"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1090
#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1193
msgid "Default: #e2e8f0 (fd-gray-200)"
msgstr "默认值：#e2e8f0 (fd-gray-200)"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1096
msgid "Default: #0f172a (fd-gray-900)"
msgstr "默认值：#0f172a (fd-gray-900)"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1107
msgid ""
"When enabled, a left border is shown on hover; when disabled, the border is "
"hidden."
msgstr "启用后显示悬停时的左侧边框，关闭则隐藏边框。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1116
msgid "Default: #72aee6 (hover left border color)"
msgstr "默认值：#72aee6（悬停时左侧边框颜色）"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1122
#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1140
msgid "Default: #3b82f6 (fd-primary)"
msgstr "默认值：#3b82f6 (fd-primary)"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1134
msgid "Default: leave empty (no background color)"
msgstr "默认值：留空（无背景色）"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1151
msgid ""
"When enabled, a left border is shown on hover of the current selected item; "
"when disabled, the border is hidden."
msgstr "启用后显示当前选中项悬停时的左侧边框，关闭则隐藏边框。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1160
msgid "Default: #ffffff (current selected item left border color)"
msgstr "默认值：#ffffff（当前选中项左侧边框颜色）"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1166
msgid ""
"Default: #ef4444 (fd-error). Background color for update count, "
"notification badges, etc."
msgstr "默认值：#ef4444 (fd-error)。用于显示更新数量、通知数量等徽章的背景色。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1172
msgid "Default: #ffffff (white). Text color inside the badge."
msgstr "默认值：#ffffff（白色）。徽章内的文字颜色。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1186
msgid "When enabled, separators are shown between menu items."
msgstr "启用后显示菜单项之间的分隔线。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1199
msgid ""
"Default: WordPress native thickness (leave empty). Unit: px, range 1-10."
msgstr "默认值：使用 WordPress 原生粗细（留空）。单位：px，范围 1-10。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1207
msgid "Align with icon left edge"
msgstr "与图标左侧对齐"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1208
msgid "Align with menu item name"
msgstr "与菜单项名称对齐"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1210
msgid "Choose the alignment of submenu text relative to the main menu."
msgstr "选择子菜单文字与主菜单的对齐方式。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1220
msgid ""
"Default: WordPress native width (leave empty). Only effective on desktop, "
"does not affect collapsed state."
msgstr "默认值：使用 WordPress 原生宽度（留空）。仅在桌面端生效，不影响折叠状态。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1226
msgid "Default: 12 (unit: px)"
msgstr "默认值：12（单位：px）"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1232
msgid ""
"Default: WordPress native padding (leave empty). Sets the top/bottom "
"padding of main menu items."
msgstr "默认值：使用 WordPress 原生内边距（留空）。设置主菜单项的上下内边距。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1238
msgid ""
"Default: auto-calculated based on menu width (leave empty). Manually set "
"the left padding of main menu items."
msgstr "默认值：根据菜单宽度自动计算（留空）。手动设置主菜单项的左侧内边距。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1244
msgid ""
"Default: auto-calculated based on menu width (leave empty). Manually set "
"the right padding of main menu items."
msgstr "默认值：根据菜单宽度自动计算（留空）。手动设置主菜单项的右侧内边距。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1250
msgid ""
"Set the left margin of main menu items for a Notion-like indent effect. "
"Default: 0"
msgstr "设置主菜单项的左侧外边距，用于实现类似 Notion 的缩进效果。默认值：0"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1256
msgid ""
"Set the right margin of main menu items for a Notion-like indent effect. "
"Default: 0"
msgstr "设置主菜单项的右侧外边距，用于实现类似 Notion 的缩进效果。默认值：0"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1262
msgid "Set the left margin of separators. Default: 0"
msgstr "设置分隔线的左侧外边距。默认值：0"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1268
msgid "Set the right margin of separators. Default: 0"
msgstr "设置分隔线的右侧外边距。默认值：0"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1274
msgid "Default: WordPress native padding (leave empty)"
msgstr "默认值：使用 WordPress 原生内边距（留空）"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1280
msgid "Default: WordPress native border radius (leave empty)"
msgstr "默认值：使用 WordPress 原生圆角（留空）"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1300
msgid "Reset Menu Order"
msgstr "重置菜单排序"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1301
msgid "Restore the WordPress default menu order"
msgstr "恢复到 WordPress 默认菜单顺序"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1306
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset the menu order? This will restore the "
"WordPress default menu order."
msgstr "确定要重置菜单排序吗？这将恢复到 WordPress 默认的菜单顺序。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1316
msgid "Menu order has been reset."
msgstr "菜单排序已重置。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1319
msgid "Reset failed: "
msgstr "重置失败："

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1342
msgid ""
"When enabled, the left sidebar menu is automatically collapsed when entering "
"the post editor, providing more editing space. Users can still expand the "
"menu manually; after expanding, the state is preserved on page refresh."
msgstr ""
"启用后，进入文章编辑页面时左侧菜单会自动折叠，提供更大的编辑空间。"
"用户仍可手动展开菜单，展开后刷新页面会保持展开状态。"

#: includes/modules/class-fd-sidebar-menu.php:1364
msgid "When enabled, site branding is displayed at the top of the menu."
msgstr "启用后在菜单顶部显示站点标识。"
